# MP7 course team - safety case for the supervised outdoor hover test (course format)
system  vehicle "course quadcopter Q1" firmware v1.4 config c7d2
accept  6
# hazards: id "text" sev S before L after L   (team's own 1..5 scales, see F10-36)
hazard H1 "RC link lost; vehicle keeps flying without a pilot"          sev 4 before 3 after 1
hazard H2 "battery exhausted before landing; uncontrolled descent"      sev 4 before 3 after 1
hazard H3 "vehicle leaves the test area (navigation fault or wind)"     sev 4 before 2 after 1
hazard H4 "propeller contact with a person during arming or landing"    sev 5 before 2 after 1
# regulatory questions: answers come ONLY from the authority's current document
reg Q1 "Does this vehicle or its operator need registration here?" answer "see lab sheet entry 3" source "national aviation authority: rules for unmanned aircraft (current edition)" read 2026-10-02
reg Q2 "Is flight at the chosen site and height allowed, and with whose permission?" answer "see lab sheet entry 4; land-owner letter on file" source "national aviation authority: rules for unmanned aircraft (current edition)" read 2026-10-02
goal     G0 - "The supervised hover test at the course field is acceptably safe"
strategy S1 G0 "Argue over each identified hazard, then over the procedure"
goal     G1 S1 "RC loss leads to a controlled return and landing" hazard H1
evidence E1 G1 "SITL failsafe matrix F1, F2 (F10-35)" result PASS firmware v1.4 config c7d2
evidence E2 G1 "bench test: transmitter off, props removed, RTL shown" result PASS firmware v1.4 config c7d2
goal     G2 S1 "Low battery leads to landing with charge to spare" hazard H2
evidence E3 G2 "SITL failsafe matrix F4, F5" result PASS firmware v1.4 config c7d2
evidence E4 G2 "capacity parameter checked against the pack label" result PASS firmware v1.4 config c7d2
goal     G3 S1 "The vehicle cannot leave the test area unnoticed" hazard H3
evidence E5 G3 "SITL failsafe matrix F6 (geofence)" result PASS firmware v1.4 config c7d2
evidence E6 G3 "pre-arm compass check on the field (F10-37 checklist)" result PASS firmware v1.4 config c7d2
goal     G4 S1 "Nobody can be within reach of the propellers when armed" hazard H4
evidence E7 G4 "field procedure: exclusion zone, arming call-out (F10-37)" result PASS firmware v1.4 config c7d2
goal     G5 S1 "The test follows the signed procedure"
evidence E8 G5 "go/no-go record signed by the supervisor (F10-37)" result PASS firmware v1.4 config c7d2
